{"summary":"Uncertain of his sister's fate, a boy enters LIMBO.","description":"What the press said: \n\n“Limbo is as close to perfect at what it does as a game can get.” \n10/10 – Destructoid \n\n“The game is a masterpiece.” \n5/5 – GiantBomb \n\n“Limbo is genius. Freaky, weird genius. Disturbing, uncomfortable genius.” \n5/5 – The Escapist \n\n“Dark, disturbing, yet eerily beautiful, Limbo is a world that deserves to be explored.” \n5/5 – Joystiq \n\nWinner of more than 100 awards, including: \n\nGameinformer’s “Best Downloadable” \nGamespot’s “Best Puzzle Game” \nKotaku’s “The Best Indie Game” \nGameReactor’s “Digital Game of the Year” \nSpike TV’s “Best Independent Game” \nX-Play’s “Best Downloadable Game” \nIGN’s “Best Horror Game”\n\nLimbo is an award-winning indie adventure, critically acclaimed for its captivating puzzle design and immersive sound and visuals. Its dark, misty spaces and haunting narrative will stay with you forever.","esrbNotes":"Mild Blood, Mild Violence","pegiNotes":"Strong Violence","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Y4HSyVXKYz8?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ZNxJ7aoUznTe1ju5d0uWVs0I7JHg0MY1nsAHoijZe5JMQDEJhR_O09W0ssSwiFdfXsCqgnlUTPx3wfOsAQiKlNU","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/uS95PxOzYvU3ekdcQZVwSYo7owsUDD8Y-Tcn1kzfgKRLV9rjgqkE6yQo6EafUMphG1OgqbWhSmda-4LlbnXn","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/byDj9S07zHFslq_CAEhqFL_ohhlXdEPUkESczOEA-Oyq9Mz2jVlPnk9KBdkyaz0XTD3CayCtCN_x88jfY6H7","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/3_xyVPHrKP5RsMDrI6DiRJwyeCSQhkun-TiJCDzLMVzM09IkrRyXTZLNaygwDqPccv6HkP0ziXIVNOl8QcSPLMI","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hwb_QSF4XzHMPw3_FZE_XAYxpudJcQxqJa5WNCWt7l60-qoV7PiknVCblC4ntNf25m767iY6v1oYxbCjcaT5","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WVb3lFHHd6-R_G4A4S8DHPyW4F4Ajkc8Ugii5kfGmvl5PdS0gbsA1IP1ZmoJv-7pjEr0tHwp2YtuCXifxB_W","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/XGHjZ4Nlpf8p15p322lfN_AUZ0oTI-_KG1ruoWnELWEMwl0ev